    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\frac{55}{27}$\n\nEquate the indices, then solve $\\frac3{11}x=\\frac59$.",
      "worked": "Apply the power rule and equate indices.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac3{11}x&=\\frac59 \\\\ x&=\\frac59\\times\\frac{11}{3} \\\\ &=\\frac{55}{27}\\end{align*}$$",
